heta ({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\n$$\n\nThen, we use ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1 \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253574 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1815e8ee-c289-5f64-9f4d-5df43b4aab39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250764} {:answer/id #uuid "25423e87-2e31-52ea-9bed-9680a8ad4d75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250872} {:answer/id #uuid "380b2f49-3850-505e-a125-48611fc7669a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251019} {:answer/id #uuid "b6fc9b1c-0a28-54c2-82c9-b8ff1ad7eae4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252166} {:answer/id #uuid "bb0ddaa2-dc14-5f83-8293-f70b43e52381" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252200}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "380b2f49-3850-505e-a125-48611fc7669a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251019} :answer-field/id #uuid "a308e80e-fc90-57c9-9815-5d63c4e60f59" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186253090}] :question/difficu